---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Teaching | Amirhossein Eskorouchi"
  description="Teaching and student mentoring experience of Amirhossein Eskorouchi."
>
  <article class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Teaching &amp; Mentoring</h1>
      <p class="page-introduction">
        Engineering education, research mentoring, and student development.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Teaching</h2>

      <p>
        My teaching approach connects theoretical foundations with computational
        practice and real engineering problems. I aim to help students understand
        not only how to apply a method, but also why it works, when it is appropriate,
        and how its assumptions affect real decisions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Student mentoring</h2>

      <p>
        I have mentored graduate and undergraduate researchers through project
        formulation, literature review, data preparation, model development,
        experimental evaluation, technical writing, presentation, and professional
        development.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Areas of instruction and support</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Machine learning and deep learning</li>
        <li>Optimization and quantitative modeling</li>
        <li>Computer vision and image analysis</li>
        <li>Research methodology and reproducibility</li>
        <li>Python, GitHub, and technical computing workflows</li>
        <li>Technical writing and research presentation</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <p>
        The complete record of teaching and mentoring activities will be connected
        to the academic CV as the website documents are added.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
